==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|malison|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|maledictio|maledictiō|lang=la}}, from the past participle stem of {{term|maledico|maledīcō|I speak ill of|lang=la}}, from {{term|male||wickedly, badly|lang=la}} + {{term|dico|dīcō|say, speak|lang=la}}.  Compare {{term|malediction|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmælɪzən/|/ˈmælɪsən/}}

